WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.480 --> 00:00:02.149 align:start position:0%
 
keanu reeves is one of the world's most  beloved actors known for his fantastic  work in action movies like the matrix  and the john wick series though his life  has had its fair share of tragedies and  hardships that made him into the man he  is today  the emotional gut punches started at a  very young age for keanu reeves he was  just a three-year-old kid when his  father samuel reeves abandoned the  family  leaving his wife patricia to raise their  two children alone predictably he and  keanu's relationship has devolved since  then from rocky to completely  non-existent  in the 90s samuel was arrested for  possession of cocaine and heroin and  received a 10-year jail sentence  he's been out for a good while but his  relationship with his son never  recovered  both men have commented on their falling  out in the years since piano told  rolling stone in 2000  the story with me and my dad's pretty  heavy it's full of pain and woe and  [ __ ] loss and all that  clearly despite the fact that the two  men haven't spoken in years the pain  that lingers between them endures  given how young keanu was when his  father left the family that's a whole  lot of time he's had to spend dealing  with difficult feelings toward his  father for his part samuel told the  mirror piano's made it clear that he  wants nothing to do with me he went on  to add  i'm embarrassed by it all piano said my  life was tragic and oh boy does that  hurt  sad yeah i never figured things would  end up this way but he'll always be my  boy  reeves newly single mother patricia move  frequently from state to state  and marriage to marriage though there's  a lot of love there this sort of  constant upheaval is hard for anyone to  deal with let alone a kid  after reeves father left patricia took  the little clan from australia to new  york city  once settled in the big apple she met  and married broadway director paul aaron  in 1970 the couple moved to toronto  shortly after  sadly the romance didn't last but  happily enough aaron remained friendly  with reeves often giving him career  advice and helping him secure some early  acting jobs  the reeves family remained in the  yorkville neighborhood of toronto  throughout much of the 1970s and into  the following decade in 1976 patricia  married rock music promoter robert  miller but they unfortunately split in  1980.  her next marriage the hairdresser jack  bond lasted until 1994 by which time  reeves had become an established force  in hollywood  as a kid reeves struggled academically  attending four separate high schools in  total he never did earn his diploma and  never pursued higher education are you  going to graduate  graduate  reeves was in fact expelled from one of  his many schools as he told the daily  mail in 2008  it was difficult i went to four  different high schools in five years i  was okay academically good at english  and creative writing i was on the chess  team he added some reasons for the  problems including the size of the  school and numerous conflicts with  students and staff  saying i was one of those why kids i  asked too many questions about  everything  i couldn't stop even if it got me into  trouble i wanted my autonomy and if you  wanted to impose something on me then  you and i would have a problem  still he took the expulsion hard saying  it's a terrible letter to receive saying  you can't come back to school next year  getting asked to leave was very  upsetting in the end though it inspired  him to get serious about acting  by the late 80s keanu reeves was already  landing some major enviable roles most  notably in the legendary goofball buddy  comedy bill and ted's excellent  adventure  a few years later he embraced mature  films like 1990s i love you  to death and the following years my own  private idaho a drama about two street  hustler friends who embark on a journey  of self-discovery  reeves became fast friends with his  co-star in those two films river phoenix  phoenix was on a similar career  trajectory to reeves at the time having  broken into serious roles in the late  80s  unfortunately as is often the case with  young celebrities phoenix struggled with  the pressures of fame and ultimately  turned to drugs  on october 31 1993 tragedy struck when  phoenix collapsed outside los angeles  viper room  nightclub and died hours later at the  age of 23. the tragedy stunned hollywood  and reeves in particular as reeves told  the guardian in 2019  phoenix was definitely one of my closest  friends from that era who shared an  artistic sensibility river was just so  down to earth spiritual and a unique  artist yeah i miss him  by the late 90s keanu had broken out of  rising star status and become a bonafide  leading man  this happened largely on the backs of  1994's speed in which he played a young  cop trapped on a bus that's set to blow  if it travels slower than 50 miles per  hour  in 1999's the matrix in which he played  a man who discovers the world around him  as a simulation  it was around this time that he met and  fell in love with jennifer syme an  actress and personal assistant  before long jennifer was pregnant  however shortly before christmas 1999  syme noticed she hadn't felt movement  from the baby in days the two rushed to  the hospital where ultrasound tests  revealed the worst case scenario was  indeed true  sime delivered their stillborn daughter  eva archer syme reeves on december  24th 1999. understandably this loss  devastated both parents  as an anonymous friend told the globe in  2000 he really had his heart set on  becoming the dad  instead he and jennifer are undergoing  grief counseling to try and help them  cope with their anguish the loss of a  child is one of the most intense  tragedies a person can endure inevitably  it takes a massive toll on relationships  especially the one between the child's  parents this was very much the case with  keanu reeves and jennifer sein  sadly but very much understandably the  couple split a few weeks after laying  their daughter to rest  in january 2000. despite this reeves and  sein remained close after the breakup  on april 1st 2001 reeves met simon at  san francisco's crepes on coal  a popular brunch spot according to  people according to the sun she attended  a party at the home of marilyn manson  that evening  for reasons unknown after being dropped  off at her own home she left again  this time in her own vehicle shortly  after six am sime's car slammed into a  trio of parked cars she wasn't wearing a  seatbelt and was thrown from the vehicle  she died instantly the tragedies of  losing his child and former partner  changed reeves forever years later the  grief still lay heavily upon him  reeves told parade in 2006 grief changes  shape but it never ends  people have a misconception that you can  deal with it and say it's gone and i'm  better  they're wrong when the people you love  are gone you're alone  keanu reeves should have been enjoying  the peak of his acting career in the  late 90s and early aughts  however the nearly back-to-back losses  he endured during this period cast a  shadow over just about everything he did  on top of that his younger sister kim  had been fighting leukemia since 1991.  this long battle with cancer took an  enormous toll luckily she had the  support of her loved ones including her  big brother  according to a 1999 article in  australia's woman's day  reeves supported her through the years  following her diagnosis sending flowers  and special messages to a sick sister at  least once a week  reeve said i love kim she's so brave and  i want the very best for her you can  star and hit movies but that's nothing  compared to going through what kim's  been through  fortunately for everyone involved kim  reeves went into remission in 1999  as years went on reeves began taking on  more serious roles  the critics could be merciless now we'll  admit his attempt at an english accent  in 1992's bram stoker's dracula  is not great i doubted everything  even my mind i was impotent with fear  i know but it and other reeves  performances didn't merit the tidal wave  of mockery the actor soon faced  though the first matrix movie was a hit  the subsequent two were not as beloved  critics and fans alike began attacking  what they saw as reeves wooden  underperformance as protagonist neo  in his defense most of the main  characters in the matrix franchise have  the same deadpan expression no matter  what's happening  but while hugo weaving gets to cackle  and snarl as the villainous agent smith  reeves neo simply  doesn't emote ever all these years later  his infamously low-key one-word  catchphrase remains memorable  whoa but that is one can easily argue  the point of the character  luckily reeves has since found a  comfortable home in the excellent john  wick series where a subtle performance  as a grief-stricken terrifyingly skilled  protagonist makes a lot of sense  plus you're too amazed by the incredible  fight choreography to really care much  one way or the other  reeves is quite the philanthropist  although he doesn't like to draw  attention to this  regarding one of his charitable projects  reeves said in 2009  i have a private foundation that's been  running for five or six years and it  helps aid a couple of children's  hospitals in cancer research i don't  like to attach my name to it  i just let the foundation do what it  does in addition to his generosity  reeves is also shockingly private  largely shining the flashy celebrity  lifestyle  as a result of all this generosity and  humility reeves reputation has  drastically transformed in recent years  he's gone from being dismissed as a  moderately talented action star to a  beloved figure of hollywood  all this sudden adoration might seem a  bit much but it's not going anywhere  anytime soon the story of a man who's  been through so much only to remain a  generous  quiet person is just too wholesome for  the internet not to fawn over  check out one of our newest videos right  here plus even more looper videos about  your favorite celebrities are coming  soon  subscribe to our youtube channel and hit  the bell so you don't miss a single one

